From: Rance9 <rance9@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 11:42:41 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Mapper 30: bus conflicts latch the AND of the written and
 ROM values

Boards with bus conflicts (submapper 0 without the battery bit, and
submapper 2) latch the bitwise AND of the CPU's value and the ROM byte,
as datalatch.c does.
---
 src/boards/unrom512.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/boards/unrom512.c b/src/boards/unrom512.c
index 5494060..56bd58e 100644
--- a/src/boards/unrom512.c
+++ b/src/boards/unrom512.c
@@ -139,7 +139,7 @@ static DECLFW(UNROM512LLatchWrite) {
 
 static DECLFW(UNROM512HLatchWrite) {
 	if (bus_conflict)
-		latche = (V == CartBR(A)) ? V : 0;
+		latche = V & CartBR(A);
 	else
 		latche = V;
 	latcha = A;
